    "No direct experimental oral bioavailability data for the query molecule.",
    "All analogues have low Morgan similarity (<0.3) to the query.",
    "No direct data on solubility, permeability, efflux, or first-pass metabolism for the query.",
    "Some analogues show dose/formulation/food effects and interindividual variability, so exact F for the query is uncertain."
